Algorithms, serialization layouts, and constants in this library are ported
from Apache DataSketches so that sketches serialized by either library can be
read by the other.

The serialized sketch snapshots under test/Clast.Sketches.Tests/data are copied
verbatim from the Apache DataSketches Technology Compatibility Kit:

  https://github.com/apache/datasketches-tck
  Copyright 2015-2025 The Apache Software Foundation
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The MurmurHash3 implementation derives from Apache DataSketches'
org.apache.datasketches.hash.MurmurHash3, which is in turn derived from
Austin Appleby's MurmurHash3_x64_128 reference implementation
(https://github.com/aappleby/smhasher), released into the public domain.

